### USER REGISTER

POST http://localhost:3001/api/auth/register
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "username":"Javier",
  "email":"javiercolodro@gmail.com",
  "password":"javier123"
}

### USER LOGIN 

POST http://localhost:3001/api/auth/login
Content-type: application/json

{
  "email":"javiercolodro@gmail.com",
  "password":"javier123"
}

### USER LOGOUT

POST http://localhost:3001/api/auth/logout


### PETICIONES DE PRODUCTOS

GET http://localhost:3001/api/products
Content-Type: application/json


### CREAR PRODUCTO
POST http://localhost:3001/api/products
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "name": "Nintendo Switch",
  "description" : "Consola de videojuegos híbrida con pantalla OLED de 7 pulgadas, colores vibrantes y 64GB de almacenamiento interno",
  "price": 500,
  "stock": 15,
  "imageUrl": "https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61-PblYntsL._AC_SL1500_.jpg"
}

### ACTUALIZAR PRODUCTO CON PUT
PUT http://localhost:3001/api/products/692c930483aa79db6533cf72
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "stock": 3
}

### GET Obtener un producto por id
GET http://localhost:3001/api/products/692c930483aa79db6533cf72

### DELETE PRODUCT
DELETE http://localhost:3001/api/products/692c930483aa79db6533cf72

### ADD TO CART
POST http://localhost:3001/api/cart/add
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "userId": "694021d92baa3497a981d046",
  "productId": "694022842baa3497a981d04a",
  "quantity": 1
}

### GET CART
GET http://localhost:3001/api/cart/get/692b4ddc3551dd881cd30685

### UPDATE CART
PUT http://localhost:3001/api/cart/update/692b4ddc3551dd881cd30685
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "productId": "692eebfb95d295b0bf447061",
  "quantity": 2
}

### DELETE PRODUCT FROM CART
DELETE http://localhost:3001/api/cart/removeproduct/692b4ddc3551dd881cd30685
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "productId" : "692eebfb95d295b0bf447061"
}

### CLEAR CART
DELETE http://localhost:3001/api/cart/clear/692b4ddc3551dd881cd30685

### GET CART TOTAL
GET http://localhost:3001/api/cart/total/692b4ddc3551dd881cd30685

